msgid "How many turns of messages the overview's Notifications tab keeps."
msgstr "Koliko redova poruka čuva kartica Obavijesti u pregledu."

msgid "Unciv's tutorials: a message when something new comes up, and a task card with the next thing to try."
msgstr "Unciv-ovi vodiči: poruka kada se pojavi nešto novo i kartica zadatka sa sljedećom stvari koju treba isprobati."

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Resetiraj"

msgid "Unciv's own sound effects. They are read from the Unciv folder next to this one when the game runs; put your own in ~/.unciv-vr/Sounds under the same names to replace them."
msgstr "Uncivovi vlastiti zvučni efekti. Čitaju se iz mape Unciv pored ove kad se igra pokrene; stavite svoje u ~/.unciv-vr/Sounds pod istim imenima da ih zamijenite."

msgid "%d sounds found. Every unit's attack sound comes from the ruleset, like Unciv's."
msgstr "Pronađeni zvukovi %d. Zvuk napada svake jedinice dolazi iz skupa pravila, poput Unciva."

msgid "No sounds found. They live in Unciv's android/assets/sounds, next to this folder."
msgstr "Nije pronađen nijedan zvuk. Oni žive u Uncivovom android/assets/sounds, pored ove mape."

msgid "Boards with a list on them, built from what the game knows. In VR they stand around the table "
msgstr "Ploče s popisom na njima, izgrađene od onoga što igra poznaje. U VR stoje oko stola "

msgid "(hold the trigger on the strip along the top to move one); on the desktop they sit down the left side."
msgstr "(držite okidač na traci duž vrha da pomaknete jedan); na radnoj površini sjedaju s lijeve strane."

msgid "A panel is a folder with a panel.json - see panels/README.md. Put yours in %s."
msgstr "Ploča je mapa s panel.json - pogledajte panels/README.md. Stavite svoju u %s."

msgid "Put them back"
msgstr "Vrati ih natrag"

